OL,3,GNEWSAGas firm had safety issues before
OL,4,Afatal explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn energy company's safety procedures
OL,7,Fwere not up to industry standards prior
OL,8,Fto a fatal gas explosion, a trial has
OL,9,Fheard.
OL,11,FTen people died following the blast at
OL,12,Fthe Haut du Mont flats in St Helier,
OL,13,FJersey, in the early hours of 10
OL,14,FDecember 2022.
OL,16,FGas workers Neil Armstrong, 58, John
OL,17,FWright, 60 and Lee Ward, 59, deny 10
OL,18,Fcounts of gross negligence
OL,19,Fmanslaughter. Island Energy,
OL,20,Frepresented by chief executive Graeme
OL,21,FMillar, has also pleaded not guilty in
OL,22,Fa combined health and safety case.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
