OL,3,GNEWSAGas firm had safety issues before
OL,4,Afatal explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trial at the Royal Court heard the
OL,7,Fcompany did not have systems in place
OL,8,Fto ensure employees were carrying out
OL,9,Fsafe work.
